<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">NAMBYA TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">BaKolose</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo lwaPaulu Kuba Kolose</para>
  <para style="toc2">BaKolose</para>
  <para style="toc3">BaKolo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo LwaPaulu</para>
  <para style="mt1">KUBAKOLOSE</para>
  <para style="imt">Matangisilo</para>
  <para style="ip">Lukwalo lwabaKolose lwakakwalwa noMpositoli Paulu (baKolose 1.1). Lukwalo yolu wakalukwala elimuntolongo, kungaba kuRoma, kuyeyeselwa kuti kungaba makole makumi mashanu negumi mushule mokuzwalwa kwaKristo. BaKolose, pamwempela nabaEfesu naFilimoni, makwalo anoshobwa kuwhi makwalo omuntolongo nokuti Paulu wakawakwala elimuntolongo. Yolu lukwalo wakalukwalila igubungano lyomuguta lyeKolose. Paulu atoba iye wakatanga igubungano lyokuKolose, sokuleba kukwe mubaKolose 2.1, koga wakazwitola zwili unshingo uwe kuti ebababalile. Zwinotubukana kuti igubungano yeli lyakatangiswa naEpafulasi nokuti wakabeva muguta lyeKolose.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulu wakabetenhuuswa nendayijo yoniepa mugubungano lyeKolose. Wakakwala palefu mulukwalo yolu elebeleka nozwazwo. Kungaba kuti kwakabelina igapo lyabaJuda lyakabemanikija bamwe badimbwi kuti betobele mulawo wechiJuda weChivumilano chantolo muBhayibhili, kasa imhalajo. Paulu unokwala kubaKristo eti, apana chimwe chinodikana kwabali kana umwe unhu kuzhe kwaKristo kuti betambulike kunaMwali (BaKolose 1.15-20). Nokuti akale indayijo inova mundangalilo yonhu aitobhancha (BaKolose 2. 8)</para>
  <para style="iot">Zwilomumwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulu unotanga lukwalo nokumusa igubungano lyomuKolose (baKolose 1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kova ekwala nobukulwana bwaKristo, kasa eshandula indayijo yoniepa yakabelayijwa muKolose (baKolose 1.3—3.4)</para>
  <para style="io1">Sezwinowanikwa mumakwalo manji aPaulu, unotola chikamu chokumapejelejo wolukwalo elayija indayijo imomunsi nobugalo bubuyanana bwechiKristo (baKolose 3.5—4.6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulu unopejeleja nokumusa akale nendayo kuti lukwalo lubalwe munaamwe makubungano kubanhu bose (baKolose 4.7-18)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Imi Paulu, umpositoli waKristo Jesu nechido chaMwali, akale naTimoti mwanakwaina wedu.<verse eid="COL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />Kubachena nabanakwaina banodimbwa muna Kristo muKolose.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Chipiwo nolunyalalo lwaMwali Tate bedu ngalube kunamwi.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unamato woboka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Unshaji wose toboka Mwali, Tate baTezi wedu Jesu Kristo, patinomunamatila, <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />nokuti takawha kudimbwa kwenu munaKristo Jesu akale noludo lwamunanalo kubachena bose, <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />pezhulu polubimbo lwamunolondotelwa kudenga. Yezwi mwakazwiwha kale muwhi lyechokomende, indebo imbuya <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />yakezha kwamuli. Sezwimutikana mupasi lyose, indebo imbuya ikumuzwala unchelo akale imukubuka, pakati penu kuva nezhuba limwakawha akale mukawhisisa chipiwo chaMwali muchokomende chose, <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />sezwa mwakalayijwa naEpafulasi unshingikwaina unodikana. Iye unshingi ulobimbika munaKristo akamilila isu, <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />akale wakata kuti kuzibikane kwatili ludo lwenu muMpepo.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Nechisoko yechi, kuva izhuba litakazwiwha yezwi, isu atijakalekeja kumunamatila, tikumbila kuti Mwali emuzhaje noluzibo lwechido chiche, kundila mubuchenjevu bose boMpepo nokuwhisisa, <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />kuti mulalame bupenyu bunokwelela Tezi, buzhele kushantisa iye, buzwala unchelo mumishingo mibuya akale nokupamijika muluzibo lwaMwali. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Musimiswe namasimba ose, nokuda kokungaima kukulugulu, kunabo bose balo simatila akale nomwoyo ndefu, unalushanto <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />mupakuboka kunaTate, bakata kuti tikwelele kuwana unkobelo mufuma yabachena mulumuniko. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Iye wakatichija mubutongo bwenhilima akale akatisenga kubushe boMwananhulumyana uwe unodikana, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />muna Iye tina lumunulo nokulekejelwa koluchinyo.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">UNshingo waKristo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kristo untojaniso waMwali usinoboneka, imbano yezwi bumbwa zwose, <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />nezwo muna iye zwinhu zwose zwakabumbwa, kudenga akale nopenyika, zwinoboneka nezwisinoboneka, zwigalo kana buchinda kana isimba zwose zwinhu zwakabumbwa pezhulu pape akale zwibumbilwa iye. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Upombeli pezwinhu zwose akale munaiye zwinhu zwose zwilobhatana pamwempela. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Iye ndiye unsholo wombili, igubungano, ndiye matangisilo, imbano kuva kubafi, kuti munaizwo zwose ndiye angaba umbuya. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Nokuti munaiye kose kuzhala kwaMwali kwakashantilwa kugala mwaali, <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />akale pezhulu pape wakakamujanisa zwinhu zwose naiye, zwopenyika kana zwokudenga, ebuza lunyalalo nelopa lyakakutuka panchinjikwa uwe.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Akale namwi, baka bakapambuka muli kule naye noumwe unshaji mulinolunyetelo mundangalilo jenu muta zwito zwibi, <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />koga ngweno iye wakamukamujanisa mumbili uwe nolufu lulwe, kutila kuti emupile imwi muli bachena akale musina chibi kana undandu mbeli kukwe, <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />chete mungogala mukudimbwa, mwakajikama akale mukasungwala musinobhuda mulubimbo lwendebo imbuya imwakawha, yakapupulwa kuchibumbwa chose pasi pedenga, akale chili icho chakatisa kuti imi, Paulu ndibe unshingili.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unshingo waPaulu soNshingi weGubungano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Ngweno ndoshanta mukujiila kwangu, pezhulu penu, akale mumbili wangu ndizhajikija zwikumushomopala mukuyabiswa kwaKristo mumbili uwe, lili igubungano, <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />zwakata kuti ndibe unshingili, sokuda konshingo wandakapilwa imwi, kuti iwhi lyaMwali lizibikane zwizhele, <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />isiswa lyakasisika kwamakole namakole akale nokwe zwizekululu zwinji koga ngweno zwatondejelwa kubachena babe. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Kwabali Mwali wakashala kuzibisa Bokuzhe bukulwana bwefuma yolukujo bwesiswa yeyi, eli Kristo munamwi, lubimbo lolukujo. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Iye watinopupula, tichenjeja unhu ose akale tilayija unhu ose buchenjevu bose, kuti tipile unhu ose ekakubuka munaKristo. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Nezwo ndizwo ndishingilila, ndifundumala nesimba lilye, lindinyungumula.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Nokuti ndoda kuti imwi muzibe kuti ndofundumala chini nditila imwi, akale nabokuLaodesiya, naabo bose basanu bandibona, <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />kuti myoyo yabo isimiswe sezwo bakabhataniswa pamwempela muludo, kuba nefuma inobuza nokuwhisisa zwilobimbiswa akale kutila kuti bezibe isiswa yaMwali, unoba eliKristo, <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />munaIye mulosiswa ifuma yose yobuchenjevu noluzibo.<verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Ndoleba yezwi kutila kuti pesibe ipo uchamuchenga nokulebeleka kunonyungumula. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Kojoba ndisinanamwi kwombili, koga mumpepo ndinanamwi, ndoshantila kubona kulonganyika kwenu akale nokudimbwa kwenu kunamiji munaKristo.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bupenyu Buzhele munaKristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Sezwo mwakatambula Kristo Jesu uli Tezi, nokudalo galani muna iye, <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />mube nemiji, mubakwe muna iye muzikatile mukudimbwa, sokulayijwa kwenu, muzhale kuboka.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Mubone kuti pesibe nouchamuta inhapwa nendayijo iye kana nokuchengeja nokukakabajana kusina zwipo, nengalilo jobunhu, kana mipepo yomunyika, koga zwisi zwaKristo. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Nokuti muna iye ndimo mugele umbili obumwali bose buzhele, <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />imwi mwaba nobupenyu buzhele muna iye, ulinsholo wobutongi nesimba lyose.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Muna iye akale mwakamhalajwa imhalajo isinotiwa namaboko, nokubhisa umbili wenyama nemhalajo yaKristo, <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />akale mwakajikwa naye pakubhabhatizwa, akale mukamuswa pamwempela naye nokudimbwa kwenu namasimba aMwali, iye wakoomusa mubafi. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Akale imwi mwakabakafa muluchinyo akale nokusomhalajwa mumibili yenu, Mwali wakata kuti pebe nobupenyu pamwempela naye, nokulekelela luchinyo lwedu lose, <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />ajima zwisungo zwakabekoneja zwomulawo, yezwi wakazwibhisa, nokuzwikahamila panchinjikwa. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Akoma buchinda nesimba wakazwita chitondejelo kunaibo bose, ezwikoma zwose nonchinjikwa.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Nokudalo pesibe kana umwempela uchapa untongo kwamuli penyaya yozwokulya kana zwinonwiwa kana imhembelelo kana mweji wagala kana isabata. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Yezwi untuzi chete wezwikumuzha, koga mongo ndiKristo nokukwe. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Kusibe kana umwempela uchamubhisa munzila, nokunangatila kuzwideleja koniepa, akale nokunamata batumwa baMwali, nokusimatija zwibono, ezwifufumula zwisina chisoko, zwili zwomundangalilo yobunhu, <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />akale esinobhatilila nesimba kunsholo, umbili ose kwaunowana kulya akale nokubhatana pamwempela kwemingu nenchinga jose, akale zwikubuke sezwaanoda Mwali.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufa Nokulalama naKristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Kana imwi mwakafa naKristo mumipepo yenyika, ini zwinotisa kuti mube nobupenyu bunanga soti muchimo munozwenyika? Ini zwinotisa kuti mutobele zwomulawo? <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“Usibhate yezwi, Usilabile yezwiya, Usigume zwimwe!” <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Yezwi zwinoleba kuti zwinhu zwose yezwi zwinopela zwingoshingiswa, zwili zwomulawo nendayijo yobunhu. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Zwinhu yezwi zwinoboneka zwili nobuchenjevu mukunyamula busungwali nokuzwipila, nokuzwinyolopesa akale nokutinha umbili, koga zwisinoshinga kukuzwibhata kululakamilo lwombili.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Nokudalo kana mwakamuswa pamwempela naKristo, shakani zwinhu zwopezhulu, kwaali Kristo, eligele kuluboko lolulyi lwaMwali. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Ibigani indangalilo jenu pezwinhu zwopezhulu, zwisi zwinhu zwipo pasi, <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />nokuti mwakafa, akale bupenyu bwenu bulosisika naKristo munaMwali. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Yopo Kristo iye bupenyu bwedu paachaboneka, pakalepo imwi munoboneka naye mukungaima.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bupenyu bwantolo nobupya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Nokudalo bulayani zwomunyika mwamuli, zwili busangu, bushambwa, lulakamilo, zwido zwobubi akale noluchibo, kuli kunanga sokunamata zwimwali. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Nokuda kwezwi zwinhu, bukali bwaMwali bumuzha. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Muna yezwi imwi mwakabakwenda mwazwili noumwe unshaji, muchinogala bupenyu bwenu muna izwo.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Koga ngweno zwilasheni kule zwose yezwi, kunyema, bukali, lunya, kunyeya akale nendebo imbi jinobhuda mundomo wenu. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Musiniepelane, sezwo mwakalasha lubumbo lwantolo nemishingo yalo, <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />akale mukambala lubumbo lupya, lumufhululwa muluzibo nomuchimo chombumbi wacho. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Yopa apangabe noNgiliki kana uNjuda, ulomhalajwa kana usilomhalajwa, usina luzibo, usinabupampu, undanda, unhu ulosungunuka, koga Kristo ulizwose, akale elimukati mwaizwo zwose.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Nokudalo mbalani feno sabaloshalwa baMwali, bachena akale banodikana, mbalani lutejo, ishe, kuzwideleja, bunyolo, akale nokugontama, <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />mube nomoyondefu kuna umwe noumwe, akale kana umwe eline chililijiko kuna umwe lekelelanani umwe noumwe, sezwo Tezi bakamulekelela imwi, nokudalo namwi mokwelela kulekelela. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Akale pezhulu paizwo zwose yezwi zwinhu ibani noludo, ilo lunosunga zwinhu zwose pamwempela mukuwhanana kulopelelela. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Lekejani lunyalalo lwaKristo lutonge mumyoyo yenu, lumwakashobelwa mumbili umwempela. Akale mupe kuboka. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Lekani iwhi lyaKristo ligale mwamuli zwizhele, layijanani akale mukololane umwe noumwe mubuchenjevu buzhele, akale kwimbani jimbo, inyimbo nenjimbo jompepo jokupa kuboka kunaMwali, mumyoyo yenu. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Akale zwamunota zwose kana kuleba kana muzwito, zwiteni zwose muzina lyaTezi Jesu, mupa kuboka munaMwali Tate kupindila muna iye.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukamujana mubupenyu Bupya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Bakaji zwidelejeni kubalume benu, sezwinokwelela munaTezi.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Balume idani bakaji benu, akale musibe nobukali kwabali.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Bana, whililani bazwali benu muzwinhu zwose, nokuti yezwi zwinoshantisa Tezi.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Matate, musinyemese bana benu, yezwi zwingababojeka moyo.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Balanda, whililani matezi enu munaizwo zwose sezwo beli matezi enu openyika, kusibe kondomo chete, koga zwokushantisa banhu, nomwoyo ose, mutya Tezi. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Ingaba ipi mishingo yamunota, muyinshinge nemyoyo yenu yose sabanhu bamushingila Tezi kusi kushingila banhu, <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />muziba kuti kunaTezi motambula ishabo sendipo yenu, nokuti mumushingila Tezi Kristo. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Nokuti umbipisi unoopiwa indipo iye muluchinyo lwaakata, akale apana ishalulo.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Matezi, bhatani balanda benu zwibuyanana akale zwilolulama, muzibe kuti namwibo muna naTezi kudenga.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indayilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Ndilani mbeli mwakabhatilila mukunamata, mukuchenjela nokuboka, <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />akale mutinamatilebo, kuti Mwali etizhulile unkoba wewhi, kuti tizibise isiswa yaKristo, ili iyo yakandingwinisa muntolongo, <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />kuti ndizwite zwibe pachena, sezwandinokwelela.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Untilo wenu kuna basinodimbwa ube wobuchenjevu, mushingise chibaka zwibuyanana. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Indebo yenu ibe imbuya ili noludo unshaji wose, kutila kuti muzibe kushandula unhu wose.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumusa Kopejeleja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Unkwaina wedu unodikana Tayikikasi, unshingi ulobimbika akale eli nshingikwaina munaTezi, unoomubuja zwose pezhulu pangu. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Ndimuuntuma kwamuli nechinangwa chakalechi, kuti muzibe kuti tili chini nokuti emusungwaje mumyoyo yenu, <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />akale unanaOnesimasi mwanakwaina ulobimbika akale unodikana, eli umwe wenu. Banomubuja zwose zwakatikana yokuno.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Alisitakasi unsungwakwaina umumumusa, akale naMako amaji baBhanabhasi (iye wamwawana indayilo naye kuti kana angozha kwamuli muuntambule), <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />akale Jesu unowhi Jusitasi nayiye ukumumusa. Yaba ndibo chete banhulume bechiJuda mukati mwabashingikwaina bandakashinga nabo mubushe bwaMwali, akale bendinyalaja.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Epafulasi, iye eli umwe wenu, unshingi waKristo Jesu ukumumusa, emukumbulukwa unshaji wose nokusungwala muminamato iye, kuti mume mukukubuka akale mwakasimiswa zwizhele muchido chaMwali. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Ndopa busumikiji kuti wakashinga nesimba eshingila imwi nabokuLaodesiya nabokuHayilapolisi. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Luka undapi unodikanwa naDemasi bakumumusa.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Mundimusile banakwaina bokuLaodesiya, naNimfa akale negubungano limomungumba iye. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Lukwalo yolu lungobalwa kwamuli, mubone kuti lwabalwa bo kugubungano lyokuLaodesiya, namwibo bo mubale lukwalo lunova kuLaodesiya. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Akale muti kunaAkipasi, “Ubone kuti wazhajikija unshingo uwakatambula munaTezi.”<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Imi, Paulu, ndimukwala kulezwa yoku noluboko lwangu. Mukumbulukwe maketani angu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Chipiwo chibe kwamuli.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>